{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29574","headline":"和友人戏赠二首 二 · 李商隐","name":"和友人戏赠二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迢遰青门有几关，柳梢楼角见南山。\n明珠可贯须爲佩，白璧堪裁且作环。\n子夜休歌团扇揜，新正未破剪刀闲。\n猿啼鹤怨终年事，未抵熏炉一夕间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}